# Build context for the Dagster image is data-platform/. Keep it lean and rebuild
# all derived artifacts inside the image for reproducibility (golden rule 1).
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
**/.venv/
.pytest_cache/
# dbt build artifacts — regenerated by `dbt deps` + `dbt parse` in the image.
dbt/target/
dbt/dbt_packages/
dbt/logs/
# Not part of the Dagster image.
semantic/
**/*.md
